## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and files generated by IDEs

# User-specific files
.vs/
*.user
*.rsuser
*.suo

# Build results
**/bin/
**/obj/

# NuGet packages
**/packages/
*.nupkg

# Test results
TestResults/
*.trx

# Publish output
**/publish/

# IDE directories
.idea/
.vscode/

# Keep project-level docs and pipeline tracked (do not ignore azure-pipelines.yml or AZURE_SETUP.md)
